  "_comment": "The level editor's resource library. The folder stands on its own: the sheet, the object manifest, the sound library and game.html beside this file are built from the game's own by _sync.ps1, and the editor reads nothing outside assets/editor/. A pack downloaded from the editor is given a copy of whatever it uses.",
